  "ruleText": "Csp 301.05 Declaration of Trust. The treasurer shall execute a declaration of trust that shall set forth the rights, privileges and obligations of the trust and the participants and beneficiaries of the trust.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9585, eff 11-2-09; ss by #11097, eff 5-17-16 (formerly Csp 301.04); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
